OL,3,GNEWSA'Pigs Village' Welsh name change
OL,4,Awill go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe name survived despite restrictions
OL,7,Fon the Welsh language throughout the
OL,8,F19th Century and will now be added to
OL,9,FOrdnance Survey maps, Royal Mail and
OL,10,Fproperty records.
